    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: I shook my head side to side. What the hell is going on? First a corpse
        in the toilet, now this. What is happening? Maybe I'm dreaming... I pinched
        my arm. No, I'm not asleep. I must just be really, really tired. I need some
        sleep.
