    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: The park was almost empty. People, like moths, had flocked to the light
        of the lanterns near the attractions. The dim light created an atmosphere
        of celebration, despite all the sadness - subconsciously, you still understand
        that this darkness will last for a long time.
