    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: Another round of banging on the door. This time louder. What does he
        want... His lifeless, maniacal stare wasn't aimed at the door but straight
        through it, as if he was looking directly at me. Could he be here because
        of the body in the bathroom? Not this...
