    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: Crackling in my head. Pain. Alarm clock. For all the time I've lived,
        I never got used to waking up by alarm. Is today only Tuesday? You must be
        kidding!
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
