      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: Well, yesterday I had enough time to chat with him... I can reach school
        on my own, even in the dark - it seems I'm slowly getting used to it.
