      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 1
      line: -You're right. It's... hard to be around people. And when there are so
        many... I completely lose myself. My thoughts become like dots and dashes,
        and I can't even understand them myself.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 1
      line: -And then you have to study... Remember things... It's so hard.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
