      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 4
      line: -I can barely... sleep, but today... today I finally drifted off just
        before dawn. You know...
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 4
      line: -I saw a dream. It was... like I wasn't asleep, like... I could feel
        everything just like before. I could feel my hands... and my legs...
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 4
      line: -I dreamed of the sky. The sky before dawn. So beautiful. And a field...
        with tall grass.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 4
      line: -And you and I... swinging on squeaky colorful swings. It was so nice...
        and funny.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 4
      line: -Then... in one moment, it all went dark, and I... fell into an abyss,
        into a crack in the concrete. And I woke up.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: -We'll swing together again on the swings... Don't worry.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
