      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 4
      line: -I constantly... think... how terrifying it is to die. How terrifying
        it is when... when you lose everything you had.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 4
      line: -Losing friends... Losing you. And myself. But... at the same time...
        it's so hard. I can't take it anymore.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 4
      line: -Mira, please, I beg you. Turn... it this all garbage off... so I can
        finally die...
