      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 4
      line: -Yeah. Did you lose your memory or something? You were doing a backflip
        on the swings, and they broke off. So, shall we go to the hospital? Feeling
        dizzy? Nauseous?
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
