    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: How does she keep sneaking into my apartment? Maybe I should stop giving
        keys to everyone.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: 'My body feels like it''s wrapped in a straitjacket. It took me a moment
        to realize where I was and what I was doing here.

        Today, I fell
        asleep at the desk.'
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: I don't even remember when it happened - the moment I slipped into the
        Net... it fell out of memory, like it wasn't recorded on the tape of yesterday.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: -What... What are you so happy about?
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 4
      line: -Your grumpy face! Just kidding. Today, we're all going to the festival!
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
