  - name: "\u0414\u0435\u043D\u044C3 \u041F\u0441\u0438\u0445\u0435\u044F"
    lines:
    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: "By morning, they brought me the 'Psyche' I ordered from the page\u2014a
        sphere for deep dives into the Net. I'd spent all the money I'd stolen from
        my mom on it."
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 11
      name: 0
      line: 
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: "\u0414\u0435\u043D\u044C3 \u041D\u0430\u0447\u0430\u043B\u043E
        2"
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  - name: "\u0414\u0435\u043D\u044C3 \u041D\u0430\u0447\u0430\u043B\u043E 2"
    lines:
    - type: 15
      name: 2
      line: I've been meaning to ask... Why weren't you at school yesterday?
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 15
      name: 5
      line: I decided to stay online. It was pretty lonely, but now it's not. Come
        by more often.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 15
      name: 2
      line: Your sister goes to school.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 15
      name: 5
      line: Sometimes I find it hard to understand her.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 15
      name: 5
      line: By the way, you have 'Psyche.' We can connect right now.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: "A chill ran through me. The thought of having to dive into the Net\u2026
        After such a hard, sleepless night..."
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
