    - type: 8
      name: 2
      line: The world in front of me broke into pixels, as if matter had torn into
        shreds, and from the shreds formed a whole hurricane of particles that crashed
        into my body, penetrating and covering me everywhere.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
      value: 0
      signs: 0
      var: 0
      ThoType: 0
      signsIf: 0
      emoji: 0
      menu_label: []
      menu_jump: []
      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 8
      name: 2
      line: 'I squinted, and when I opened my eyes, I was in Kir''s hugs.


        It
        feels like a dream. Warmth spread across my skin, and waves of cold followed,
        causing goosebumps and a slight shiver.


        I blushed, even though
        I barely felt the touches. I know this feeling when you hug someone in a
        dream.


        It''s like having a warm robe thrown over me that barely
        touches the skin, or the wind caressing the barely perceptible hairs on my
        body.'
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
      show: 0
      pose: 0
      spriteEffect: 0
      additionalPose: 
      music: 0
      time: 0
