    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: A concrete giant, sleeping an eternal slumber. You feel its breath like
        the pulse of the earth beneath your feet, like the roar of cars racing through
        its arteries.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
