      V3position: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    - type: 0
      name: 2
      line: It never speaks, and it seems emotionless, but you feel that calming,
        cool touch of concrete against your back if everything in your life has gone
        wrong.
      font: 0
      inv: 0
      BGname: 0
      effects: 0
      CGname: 
